        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued September 25 at 2:59PM MDT until September 25 at 3:30PM MDT by NWS Pueblo CO</headline>
        <description>At 259 PM MDT, a severe thunderstorm was located near Hoehne, or 15
miles northeast of Trinidad, moving east at 15 mph.

HAZARD...Golf ball size hail and 60 mph wind gusts.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...People and animals outdoors will be injured. Expect hail
damage to roofs, siding, windows, and vehicles. Expect wind
damage to roofs, siding, and trees.

Locations impacted include...
Model.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
